        "- read-only mycelium signal paths",
        "- Guardian Layer safety posture",
        "- proposal/candidate and verifier/status lanes",
        "- Engel Permissions ribbon with session-only password-gated request indicators",
        "- read-only file previews",
        "",
        "Safety:",
        "- Local hive map only.",
